          "text": "According to Laboratory Corporation of America (Petitioner), according to Laboratory Corporation of America (Petitioner), petitioner argues that a class action is merely a tool for aggregating claims and that any plaintiff without Article\u202fIII standing cannot be part of the class."
        },
        {
