            }
          ],
          "text": "According to Laboratory Corporation of America (Petitioner), according to Laboratory Corporation of America (Petitioner), petitioner contends that Rule\u202f23(b)(3) predominance requires all class members to share the same injury, so including uninjured plaintiffs would swamp common issues."
        },
